[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/lib/lru_cache.py: Implemented interface module for bounded LRU cache. Fixed bare import of 'pretense' to use full package path 'from pretense.parts.pretense.lib.pretense import ...'. Added @data_type decorators to CacheError, CacheCapacityError, CacheKeyNotFoundError, and CacheStats. Added @poly_type decorator to LRUCache Protocol. Added @operation decorators to all protocol methods. Includes CacheStats frozen dataclass with hits/misses/evictions counters and complete LRUCache Protocol with capacity, size, is_empty, is_full properties plus configure, get, put, peek, remove, clear, get_stats, reset_stats, and keys_in_lru_order operations.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/tests/lru_cache_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive unit tests for LRUCache lifecycle-managed singleton covering all low-level contracts: initialization, property invariants (capacity/size/is_empty/is_full), configure (capacity update, invalid capacity error, downsize eviction), get (hit with LRU promotion, miss with telemetry), put (update existing, insert below capacity, evict on capacity), peek (non-mutating observation for present/absent keys), remove (existing key return, missing key error), clear (entry reset with telemetry preservation), telemetry (stats reporting, counter reset), and keys_in_lru_order (LRU-to-MRU ordering, non-mutating, empty cache). All tests use lifecycle phase scoping pattern with enter_phase and resolve the singleton from the active scope.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/pretense/lru_cache_pretense.py: Implemented complete LruCache pretense state machine: fixed import to package-qualified path, replaced Domain.required() with concrete Domain.type()/Domain.optional()/Domain.any() domains, replaced _unimplemented_transition scaffolds with proper return values modeling LRU semantics (hit/miss tracking, eviction, ordering), restructured LruCacheState to model items/order/stats properly, fixed make_lru_cache_fakes factory return type to LRUCache, replaced try/except blocks with self.assertRaises in TestLruCacheFake, added all 14 transitions (4 properties + 10 operations) with correct state mutations and preconditions.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/lib/lru_cache_impl.py: Implemented concrete LRUCache singleton. Fixed bare pretense import to full package path. Replaced all TODO stubs and NotImplementedError raises with working implementations using collections.OrderedDict as backing store. Default capacity=100. All methods honor LRU eviction semantics, telemetry tracking (hits/misses/evictions), and spec contracts: configure validates capacity>0 and evicts on downsize, get promotes to MRU, put evicts LRU when at capacity, peek and remove don't alter recency, clear preserves telemetry. Added @operation/@override decorators matching low/lru_cache_impl.pyi spec.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/pretense/lru_cache_impl_pretense.py: Implemented implementation pseudo-state machine and real test suite: fixed bare 'parts' imports to package-qualified paths, replaced self.fail scaffold with concrete scenarios covering all LruCache operations (properties, put/get/peek/remove/clear/configure/get_stats/reset_stats/keys_in_lru_order), verifies hit/miss behavior, eviction on capacity, telemetry tracking, contract violation exceptions, and LRU ordering.
